Repaint wasm desktop after File Manager opens a file.

Opening a file mutates the editor window tree and then returns directly from the
File Manager handler. In the browser build the dialog's saved view/backing
shadow can otherwise be presented over the newly opened editor. Force a fresh
desktop repaint at that successful exit.

--- a/we_fl_unix.c
+++ b/we_fl_unix.c
@@ -1275,6 +1275,10 @@ int WpeHandleFileManager(ECNT * cn)
             svdir = NULL;
           }
 
+#ifdef __EMSCRIPTEN__
+          e_repaint_desk_nopic(cn->f[cn->mxedt]);
+#endif
+
           return(0);
         }
 
